  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certify that on 29/10/2025, the proposal as shown on the drawing(s) submitted on 29/10/2025 and numbered 2025-114-01 REV A, 2025-114-02 REV A, 2025-114-03 REV A was not lawful within the meanings of Section 191 and 192 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990. \r\nThe development fails to comply with the terms of Class E, Clause(s) E.4 of Part 1 of Schedule 2 of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended) because the outbuilding contains primary living accommodation in the form of a toilet/shower and kitchen therefore the outbuilding would not be incidental to the enjoyment of the dwelling house.\r\n"
